Text_en:
Dear nation of Iran!
Yesterday, the 22nd day of Bahman this year, you did a great job;
You made Iran proud;
You supported the Islamic Republic as always and added to its power;
The enemies who, in their statements, in their plans, seek the surrender of the Iranian nation, were disappointed.

34 million came, Iran was insured; Imam Khamenei's heart became happy; We have a call to call!!!!
 Without counting the demonstrations in thousands of villages in the country, about 34 million Iranians rose up on 22 Bahman; 

 Field estimates indicate the presence of 26 to 30 million Iranians in 22 Bahman cities and provincial centers

from Epstein Island to the city of God of the Iranians; From the decline of western morality and the unrest project to the victory of the nation with the axis of mosques, neighborhoods, the young generation and the Imamat-Ummat system.

 Today, in my 7-minute annual speech in the public hall of the Majlis, I stated clearly:

The main conflicts in the world today are not over the dollar and tariffs, nor over missiles and uranium;
